<title>INDIA: India ITC Bhadra 96/97 1st half net down.</title>
<headline>India ITC Bhadra 96/97 1st half net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>6 months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	  144.5  vs    267.0</p>
<p>    Net sales	 1,163.1  vs  1,290.4</p>
<p>    Total income    1,199.6  vs  1,394.7</p>
<p>    Expenditure	 970.6  vs    975.4</p>
<p>    Interest	     20.1  vs     49.2</p>
<p>    Depreciation	 57.1  vs     55.5</p>
<p>Note:Paper maker ITC Bhadrachalam Ltd is a subsidiary of India's tobacco major ITC Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
